  "description": "Ultra high-performance CSV, Fixed-Width, Excel (.xlsx), and JSONL file parser and writer for .NET 8+. SIMD-accelerated parsing (AVX-512/AVX2/NEON) with a zero-allocation, fixed-112-byte read hot path: UTF-8 reading is ~12% faster than Sep and CSV writing is 2-3x faster, both at a fraction of the memory. RFC 4180 compliant with fluent read/write APIs. Fixed-Width support includes field alignment, padding, overflow handling, and async streaming. Excel reading and writing with zero extra dependencies. JSONL targets AI/ML pipelines: OpenAI/Anthropic LLM fine-tuning shapes, CSV-to-JSONL conversion, embedding-API batching, an inline vector parser, and AOT-safe JsonTypeInfo. Includes async I/O, source generators for native AOT, IDataReader/DbDataReader bridges, PipeReader streaming, LINQ-style extensions, progress reporting, and custom type converters.",
  "id": "HeroParser",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-05-23T14:04:13.843Z",
  "licenseExpression": "MIT",
  "licenseUrl": "https://licenses.nuget.org/MIT",
