  "packageHash": "O1y/jZ0Hung3KEn7zL59XHKgToJ2cHu5OyAzJBBoV/LeOgQG4uV+0w/AjC/V3cZcipJ0IB1ml+pGtWmv5qma8A==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 1197049,
  "published": "2026-05-23T14:01:34.677Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.2.0 adds JSONL as a first-class format: Jsonl.Read/Write builders, JSONL DbDataReader, CSV-to-JSONL converters for OpenAI/Anthropic fine-tuning shapes (and the reverse direction), BatchAsync embedding-API batching, and an inline VectorParser for embedding columns. A new AVX-512 UTF-8 read path is ~12% faster than Sep at a fixed 112-byte allocation, and native-AOT publish is now validated end-to-end in CI. Backward compatible with 2.1.x. Full changelog: https://github.com/KoalaFacts/HeroParser/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
